@startuml rnn_v2_architecture
skinparam backgroundColor white
skinparam componentStyle rectangle
skinparam nodesep 60
skinparam ranksep 50
skinparam defaultFontName Microsoft YaHei,SimHei,SimSun,sans-serif

title rnn_v2 Skip-Connection Architecture\nGRUPolicyModelV2 (~10.5K params) + GRUValueModelV2 (~10.5K params) = ~21K total

package "Input Layer" as InputLayer {
    [42-dim feature vector\n(1,1,42)] as Input
}

package "GRU (shared by both heads)" as GRUBlock #LightGray {
    [GRU(42→32)\nnum_layers=1] as GRU
}

package "Policy Head" as PolicyHead #LightYellow {
    [Concat(32+42=74)] as PolicyConcat
    [Linear(74→64) + ReLU] as PolicyFC1
    [Linear(64→32) + ReLU] as PolicyFC2
    [Linear(32→14) + softmax] as PolicyFC3
}

package "Value Head" as ValueHead #LightBlue {
    [Concat(32+42=74)] as ValueConcat
    [Linear(74→64) + ReLU] as ValueFC1
    [Linear(64→32) + ReLU] as ValueFC2
    [Linear(32→1)] as ValueFC3
}

Input -down-> GRU
Input -down-> PolicyConcat : skip connection
Input -down-> ValueConcat : skip connection

GRU -down-> PolicyConcat : gru_out(1,32)
GRU -down-> ValueConcat : gru_out(1,32)

PolicyConcat -down-> PolicyFC1
PolicyFC1 -down-> PolicyFC2
PolicyFC2 -down-> PolicyFC3

ValueConcat -down-> ValueFC1
ValueFC1 -down-> ValueFC2
ValueFC2 -down-> ValueFC3

note right of PolicyFC3
    Output: (probs, log_probs, new_hidden)
    mask_fn + temperature supported
end note

note right of ValueFC3
    Output: (value, new_hidden)
    No mask_fn, no temperature
    No tanh — value unbounded
end note

note bottom of Input
    Skip connection 目的：手牌、HP、能量等即时特征
    绕过 GRU 压缩瓶颈，直接让 head 感知
end note

@enduml
